{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-28","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：可公度量与中项无理线段与平方","englishTitle":"To find medial straight lines commensurable in square only which contain a medial rectangle.","book":10,"number":28,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.28","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.28/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":28,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","contentId":"euclid-10-28","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c98b9aca285cdbe731a1eb852a43c88003e706629cbf138c3d6e86ec91720626","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-28.statement","euclid-10-28.construction.1","euclid-10-28.proof.1","euclid-10-28.proof.2","euclid-10-28.proof.3","euclid-10-28.proof.4","euclid-10-28.proof.5","euclid-10-28.proof.6","euclid-10-28.proof.7","euclid-10-28.proof.8","euclid-10-28.proof.9","euclid-10-28.proof.10","euclid-10-28.proof.11","euclid-10-28.construction.2","euclid-10-28.proof.12","euclid-10-28.construction.3","euclid-10-28.construction.4","euclid-10-28.proof.13","euclid-10-28.proof.14","euclid-10-28.proof.15","euclid-10-28.proof.16","euclid-10-28.proof.17","euclid-10-28.proof.18","euclid-10-28.construction.5","euclid-10-28.proof.19","euclid-10-28.construction.6","euclid-10-28.proof.20","euclid-10-28.proof.21","euclid-10-28.proof.22","euclid-10-28.proof.23","euclid-10-28.proof.24","euclid-10-28.proof.25","euclid-10-28.proof.26","euclid-10-28.proof.27","euclid-10-28.proof.28","euclid-10-28.proof.29","euclid-10-28.proof.30","euclid-10-28.proof.31","euclid-10-28.proof.32","euclid-10-28.proof.33","euclid-10-28.proof.34","euclid-10-28.conclusion","euclid-10-28.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-28.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"749a1f70b368874087b62e167b6533cd8e1bd37855445fac2cb9d676ccb1d63b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To find medial straight lines commensurable in square only which contain a medial rectangle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"找到中项无理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度 包含 中项无理线段 矩形 的"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d7b1be9fafe35e1c4437f3d10264dec7610418a640bc03184cde81771896bd0f","citations":["euclid-6-13","euclid-6-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the rational straight lines A, B, C commensurable in square only be set out; let D be taken a mean proportional between A, B, [[VI. 13](/principles/euclid-6-13)] and let it be contrived that, as B is to C, so is D to E. [[VI. 12](/principles/euclid-6-12)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"列出有理线段 A,B,C 平方可公度而长度不可公度;D在A,B之间,取比例中项, 并假设B与C的比等于D与E的比；B 与 C 之比等于 D 与 E 之比。 [[VI. 13](/principles/euclid-6-13)] [[VI. 12](/principles/euclid-6-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ca4e47ed8a795428a1c08ce5b09f0c258ddb59edd05646b858d47352b66df06f","citations":["euclid-6-17","euclid-10-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since A, B are rational straight lines commensurable in square only, therefore the rectangle A, B, that is, the square on D [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)], is medial. [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于A,B是有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度,因此矩形 A,B,即D,中项无理线段。 [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)] [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e59b0ac7d469b302da9f0383600449a562f793778cef644922e804a8bd05bf60","citations":["euclid-10-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore D is medial. [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所以D是中项无理线段 [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"466a5c8d0b348bace888994889e11c8fc2d504fe4e4d5401012a2ceaec9c9529","citations":["euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since B, C are commensurable in square only, and, as B is to C, so is D to E, therefore D, E are also commensurable in square only. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"B,C是平方可公度而长度不可公度,B比C等于D比E,D比E也是平方可公度而长度不可公度；B 与 C 之比等于 D 与 E 之比。 [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5acff6f6029ce5309cb8fc6f78433e6870a616c7e98967e5c79e910642c18f9a","citations":["euclid-10-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But D is medial; therefore E is also medial. [[X. 23](/principles/euclid-10-23), addition]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但D是中项无理线段,因此E也是中项无理线段。 [ [X. 23](/principles/euclid-10-23)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"10cfdd60a323b61acfe982691a306dc8a3e51f96c29025c8efbb3e9c70f3c4cc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore D, E are medial straight lines commensurable in square only."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,D,E是中项无理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"decff5cd21519529edba0a056e6e08f276fdab7545768746d11aba9e66d9f3dc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that they also contain a medial rectangle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,它们也含有中项无理线段 矩形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"515818b14f60f583ff1ddeb91d74039d33abd0e0504ab483e3f379e0d2dd8efc","citations":["euclid-5-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since, as B is to C, so is D to E, therefore, alternately, as B is to D, so is C to E. [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"B比C等于D比E,因此,B比D等于D比D；B 与 C 之比等于 D 与 E 之比；B 与 D 之比等于 C 与 E 之比。 [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"13dc4f67554089d27c494e7fd6abd4c84e59cef47feb38cf5a1057acc6bc8d13","citations":["euclid-6-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as B is to D, so is D to A; therefore also, as D is to A, so is C to E; therefore the rectangle A, C is equal to the rectangle D, E. [[VI. 16](/principles/euclid-6-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,B对D的比等于D对A的比;因此,D对A的比等于C对E的比;因此,矩形对A、C等于矩形对D、E的比；B 与 D 之比等于 D 与 A 之比；D 与 A 之比等于 C 与 E 之比。 [[VI. 16](/principles/euclid-6-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0a25d50e9a16154f5294cedc497c29b533df6fc576a0975bfd4723c5c931b8ff","citations":["euclid-10-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the rectangle A, C is medial; [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)] therefore the rectangle D, E is also medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是矩形 A,C是中项无理线段,因此矩形 D,E也是中项无理线段。 [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"41a64048fd171be5ba753eec0321f6f4cb7e3aff7530b713ae60a262ea04dd0e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore medial straight lines commensurable in square only have been found which contain a medial rectangle. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,发现中项无理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度件,其中含有中项无理线段 矩形件,Q件,E D件。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4d1ee5091c2b7df5a9cb7f07af59fe4537f5657692d0e9d4bba63025626045ec","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"LEMMA I. To find two square numbers such that their sum is also square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"LEMMA I. 找到两个平方数, 其金额也为正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":13,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4f13e089644eaafea02b3937dd9a392b6283acbb6651e48f79c1e73b652a3f7e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let two numbers AB, BC be set out, and let them be either both even or both odd."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它们平凡或两者皆怪（相关点与线段：AB、BC）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4306cd7bae17ec808488a9a573939793d3822b00ec9a93d71cf1b2e9b48036a9","citations":["euclid-9-24"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then since, whether an even number is subtracted from an even number, or an odd number from an odd number, the remainder is even, [[IX. 24, 26](/principles/euclid-9-24)] therefore the remainder AC is even."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"之后,如果从偶数中减去偶数,或者从奇数中减去奇数,那么,其余的就等于偶数,因此,其余的AC是偶数。 [[IX. 24, 26](/principles/euclid-9-24)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":15,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"091571427267b682f29a12c225a6afdc4bcd59ace1b11ef3e3d5053efbe86885","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AC be bisected at D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"ACD,分两路"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":16,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8114a9c9958507db8ede51012b082650160895180731011fbd15b523bac75f08","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB, BC also be either similar plane numbers, or square numbers, which are themselves also similar plane numbers."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB,BC 也成为相似平面数,或平方数, 其本身也是相似平面数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"480e4ffc693eb6c6b6cf942b7becb279a6a94c8628d346c75c16dd2fb4c89f79","citations":["euclid-2-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now the product of AB, BC together with the square on CD is equal to the square on BD. [[II. 6](/principles/euclid-2-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在AB,BC和CD的正方形 产品等于BD的正方形。 [[II. 6](/principles/euclid-2-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"de047507e8f0f6a9b5704769c641dc408736a58e82f976977e7a019e95d562fa","citations":["euclid-9-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the product of AB, BC is square, inasmuch as it was proved that, if two similar plane numbers by multiplying one another make some number the product is square. [[IX. 1](/principles/euclid-9-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB,BC的产物是正方形, 因为事实证明,如果两个相似平面数的产物 乘以两个相似平面数, 就会使某些数量成为正方形。 [[IX. 1](/principles/euclid-9-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bb0b7418b887015d66af13e052cf27fd0bfdacac88cb3b17ba72d665ff36f668","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore two square numbers, the product of AB, BC, and the square on CD, have been found which, when added together, make the square on BD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,发现了2,平方数件,AB件,BC件,CD件,正方形件,加在一起,BD件,正方形件。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"264396c54b604cdb9eb26c5f1a297673378ab4dad8339dfe2ac133e0b9ea6424","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is manifest that two square numbers, the square on BD and the square on CD, have again been found such that their difference, the product of AB, BC, is a square, whenever AB, BC are similar plane numbers."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"很明显,有2 平方数,BD和正方形,CD的,再次发现它们的差价,即AB,BC的产值,是正方形,而当AB,BC是相似平面数时。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9e86e78319c892f512bbe23ab3e99b0b82d444616c550eb52514f7641deb2b4d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But when they are not similar plane numbers, two square numbers, the square on BD and the square on DC, have been found such that their difference, the product of AB, BC, is not square. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,当它们不是相似平面数, 发现它们有平方数, BD和正方形的DC, 它们的差额,即AB, BC, 不是正方形, Q, E,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"79f9bbb5f91791cc8924e6657cd50d27b75e99560ba51419d7006e84b9ec36f8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"LEMMA 2. To find two square numbers such that their sum is not square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"2. 发现两张平方数, 其金额不是正方形。（相关点与线段：LEMMA）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.construction.5","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":23,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"59b2f2ef61df2279fd7250aecfab8235926177c0aa37ad24fe061ec852727453","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the product of AB, BC, as we said, be square, and CA even, and let CA be bisected by D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB,BC的产物,我们说过,是正方形,CA平,CA平分D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":24,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d68f4fce8d8208ee3f57aaddc8e9f247d4d5754cb313d6525027dd032c013498","citations":["euclid-10-28"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is then manifest that the square product of AB, BC together with the square on CD is equal to the square on BD. [See [Lemma 1](/principles/euclid-10-28)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此可见,AB、BC和CD的正方形产品等于BD的正方形 [See [引理 1](/principles/euclid-10-28)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.construction.6","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":25,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9d7d127f34d6d6293320a2926b361384eee0b75829904d1efd7c36ce4caf1c9f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the unit DE be subtracted; therefore the product of AB, BC together with the square on CE is less than the square on BD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"减去DE单元;因此AB、BC和CE的正方形产品低于BD的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.20","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":26,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 20","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5f658f5542f5210293fede00b6fa3806e4484f3e38e5449bb929cdb74ef174a4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say then that the square product of AB, BC together with the square on CE will not be square."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"那么,我说,AB,BC的正方形产品和CE的正方形产品将不是正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.21","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":27,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 21","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"42c78342c1a4c99b994ade69a64e7dd64f9d587661f00f35665a6cd65b25d979","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if it is square, it is either equal to the square on BE, or less than the square on BE, but cannot any more be greater, lest the unit be divided."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,如果是正方形,它要么等于BE,要么小于BE,但不能再大,以免单位被分割。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.22","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":28,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 22","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1e3855248eff2658e1de3b382bf311e267da35858cccca66ffec3c1ead65bfa6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"First, if possible, let the product of AB, BC together with the square on CE be equal to the square on BE, and let GA be double of the unit DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先,如果可能,AB,BC和CE正方形的产物等于BE正方形,GA的产物等于DEAB的产物,GA的产物等于DE的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.23","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":29,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 23","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"336329f68c370e6435e4e1cfa8cede7ab21405d0a74448d0806509c0a96c3ce4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then the whole AC is double of the whole CD, and in them AG is double of DE, therefore the remainder GC is also double of the remainder EC; therefore GC is bisected by E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自那时以来,整个AC占全部CD的两倍,其中AG占DE的一倍,因此其余GC也是其余EC的两倍;因此,GC被E分成两部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.24","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":30,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 24","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"616a5deb1b706f0676cb14978eaf56af7cdb404a84b64e814e4d53dcf383e89d","citations":["euclid-2-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the product of GB, BC together with the square on CE is equal to the square on BE. [[II. 6](/principles/euclid-2-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,GB、BC和CE的正方形产品等于BE的正方形。 [[II. 6](/principles/euclid-2-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.25","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":31,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 25","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c773269bf7a21ac1b6ccbaf722b3c00b0c25e3226af28d8ffb766d16d1fb7210","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the product of AB, BC together with the square on CE is also, by hypothesis, equal to the square on BE; therefore the product of GB, BC together with the square on CE is equal to the product of AB, BC together with the square on CE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AB,BC和CE的正方形产品,假设也等于BE的正方形;因此GB,BC和CE的正方形产品等于AB,BC和CE的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.26","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":32,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 26","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1f26d8ee36a14bdcd77ed2109578354406f59b8104786cd5f666e7652bcef871","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, if the common square on CE be subtracted, it follows that AB is equal to GB: which is absurd."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果减去CE的正方形, AB等于GB, 这太荒谬了。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.27","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":33,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 27","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"943eea22639f47208779d75a3f4512d57f1ff3d5ab7bd0e9b621e13515147c1c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the product of AB, BC together with the square on CE is not equal to the square on BE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB、BC和CE的正方形产品不等于BE的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.28","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":34,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 28","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"671efb3f9a7ff8fe739160e7113a7ca0c1eb1c633e9ce470c39e3aca26603f9e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that neither is it less than the square on BE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来我要说的是,两者都不到BE的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.29","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":35,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 29","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d93c712fcc273bde620d91c540355ef6c4ff641bcccfea99d0442ad8f07ad1db","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let it be equal to the square on BF, and let HA be double of DF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能的话,就等于BF的正方形,HA是DF的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.30","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":36,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 30","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4391a782b4978fc3d46ccaae1e8dcc1e228d2b843d5f69ae4f6a469f375b1c1b","citations":["euclid-2-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now it will again follow that HC is double of CF; so that CH has also been bisected at F, and for this reason the product of HB, BC together with the square on FC is equal to the square on BF. [[II. 6](/principles/euclid-2-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,HC是CF的两倍;因此,CH被分成F,因此,HB、BC和FC的产品相当于BF中的正方形。 [[II. 6](/principles/euclid-2-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.31","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":37,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 31","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"489e8306793dcc218a57b93744205b4e489a1ed11a437a9bd3ccbd788e409dbf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, by hypothesis, the product of AB, BC together with the square on CE is also equal to the square on BF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是假设AB,BC的产物 加上CE的正方形 也等于BF的正方形"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.32","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":38,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 32","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"93fda790c6bea2c0d15033a9e198446a8c6a0d772db6847b4ad8f8be32cdd814","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Thus the product of HB, BC together with the square on CF will also be equal to the product of AB, BC together with the square on CE: which is absurd."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,HB,BC和CF的正方形产品也等于AB,BC和CE的正方形产品:这是荒谬的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.33","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":39,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 33","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ae44e887ee1246b71da07b6ecf67a49be0a77815dccc382d21f0f4ac7eec4be6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the product of AB, BC together with the square on CE is not less than the square on BE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB、BC和CE的正方形产品不少于BE的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.proof.34","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":40,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 34","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a90dce76f9a7c3bc640529785bd9020c3a191a9405a9509f60a4ed0584f8e3ef","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it was proved that neither is it equal to the square on BE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"事实证明,两者都相当于BE的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":41,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f7b4c398716e86322a1ea3a1d024ec16e12048d1736a958c3c64c5fe26d955e5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the product of AB, BC together with the square on CE is not square. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB,BC和CE的正方形产品不是正方形。 Q,E,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-28.source","contentId":"euclid-10-28","revisionId":"euclid-10-28@raw-c98b9aca285cdbe7","order":42,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e1f890cd8f26244e0aebf14c999f52cdefc76958c064ddc212842a890f44ba6e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.28/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.28\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-28:euclid-6-13:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-28","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-28.construction.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-13","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.28","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.28/","sourceLabel":"VI. 13"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-28:euclid-6-12:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-28","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-28.construction.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-12","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.28","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.28/","sourceLabel":"VI. 12"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-28:euclid-6-17:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-28","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-28.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-17","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.28",